div.p:
(A) All wounded Israelis and Egyptians POWs, wounded Third Army troops, wounded
                    civilians in the town of Suez and its environs will be exchanged
                    immediately;

note.p:
Source: National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Box 611,
                    Country Files, Middle East, Israel, Vol. 13, Nov. 73–Dec. 73. Secret; Immediate;
                    Nodis.
